  111|       |    //   make the significant byte < 0x80 again.
  112|       |    // - If the most significant byte is >= 0x80 and the value is negative, push a new 0x80 byte
  113|       |    //   that will be popped off when converting to an integral.
  114|       |    // - If the most significant byte is < 0x80 and the value is negative, add 0x80 to it, since it
  115|       |    //   will be subtracted and interpreted as a negative when converting to an integral.
  116|       |
